// 概要		: PServiceRelayServerHTTPAuthPasswordInput : 90B94550 本体自動更新設定／中継ｻｰﾊﾞｰ設定／HTTP認証／パスワード入力 : Okキー押下処理.
// 変更履歴 :2019/10/30 Sky大嶋 [セキュリティ技術v5][RQ824] パスワード規約拡張 API変更.
//          :2020/01/16 Sky大嶋 [セキュリティ技術v5][RQ824][OP_BTS-18388] 中継サーバパスワード規約チェック修正.
//================================================================================================.
void PServiceRelayServerHTTPAuthPasswordInput::procOk( uchar option )
{
	PLBC_MFPAutoUpdateServer* pc_MFPAutoUpdateServer = NULL;
	pc_MFPAutoUpdateServer = PLBC_MFPAutoUpdateServer::getInstance();

	if( NULL == pc_MFPAutoUpdateServer ) {
//2019/06/17 Comment [HCLT_Krishnakumar][EagleH][N Rank] Removed unwanted detailed code.
//// Comment 2015/11/02【HCLT-Juned】【制御構成変更_No.76-1】Adding error code macro.
//		LAPC_BFW_System *pc_BFW_System = LAPC_BFW_System::newInstance();
//		if (NULL != pc_BFW_System){
//			pc_BFW_System->registDetailCode( PNLD_DetailCode_Service_0x1900030100F33401 );
//		}
		LOGF_debug_PutEventLog( LOGF_DEBUG_EVENT_KIND_ALL, 0, LOGD_DEBUG_LEVEL_FATAL, "Assert Failed!" );
		return;
	}

	switch( m_uc_nowPageNum ) {
		case PNLD_ServiceDecryptPasswordP1:											//【現在のパスワード入力】.
			if( 0 == strncmp( m_sc_nowPassword, m_sc_StrKeyboard, TYPD_MAX_ServerAccsessForHTTPPassword ) ) {
				m_us_dispErrMessage = s_Space1;										// エラーメッセージをクリア.
				m_uc_nowPageNum = PNLD_ServiceDecryptPasswordP2;
			} else {
				m_us_dispErrMessage = s_SSNowPassWordMissteke;						//「ﾊﾟｽﾜｰﾄﾞが一致しません」.
				setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );
			}
			// 入力文字列とカーソル位置を初期化.
			memset( m_sc_StrKeyboard, '\0', sizeof( m_sc_StrKeyboard ) );
			m_c_SlideTextMgr.init_CLCD( m_sc_StrKeyboard, m_sc_KeyboardWidth, m_ss_MaxInputNum, m_pc_DispField, getCharSetForPanel() );
			setupGamen();
			break;

		case PNLD_ServiceDecryptPasswordP2:											//【新しいパスワード入力】.
			// 入力パスワードの文字列チェックとパスワードエラーチェックが共にOKの場合次の処理に進む.
			if( ( '\0' != m_sc_StrKeyboard[0] )
//			    && ( True == PnlComGetFWUpdateSetting()->checkServerAccsessForHTTPPassword( m_sc_StrKeyboard, m_sc_nowPassword ) ) ) {
			    && ( TYPE_CheckPwdRuleResult_Ok == PnlComGetFWUpdateSetting()->checkAdminServerAccessForHttpPwdRule( m_sc_StrKeyboard) ) ) {
				memset( m_sc_newPassword, '\0', sizeof( m_sc_newPassword ) );
				strncpy( m_sc_newPassword , m_sc_StrKeyboard, sizeof( m_sc_newPassword ) -1 );
				m_us_dispErrMessage = s_Space1;										// エラーメッセージをクリア.
				m_uc_nowPageNum = PNLD_ServiceDecryptPasswordP3;
			} else {
				m_us_dispErrMessage = s_SSNewPassWordMissteke;						//「入力したﾊﾟｽﾜｰﾄﾞは使用できません」.
				setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );
			}
			// 入力文字列とカーソル位置を初期化.
			memset( m_sc_StrKeyboard, '\0', sizeof( m_sc_StrKeyboard ) );
			m_c_SlideTextMgr.init_CLCD( m_sc_StrKeyboard, m_sc_KeyboardWidth, m_ss_MaxInputNum, m_pc_DispField, getCharSetForPanel() );
			setupGamen();
			break;

		case PNLD_ServiceDecryptPasswordP3:											//【再入力パスワード入力】.
			if( 0 == strncmp( m_sc_newPassword, m_sc_StrKeyboard, TYPD_MAX_ServerAccsessForHTTPPassword ) ) {
				// 共有メモリに新しいパスワードを設定し、元の画面に戻る.
				pc_MFPAutoUpdateServer->setHTTPPassword( m_sc_newPassword );
				nextGamen = &gp_ServiceRelayServerHTTPAuthPassword;
			} else {
				// 入力文字列に新しいパスワードを設定し、新しいパスワード入力に戻る.
				strncpy( m_sc_StrKeyboard , m_sc_newPassword, TYPD_MAX_ServerAccsessForHTTPPassword );
				m_c_SlideTextMgr.init_CLCD( m_sc_StrKeyboard, m_sc_KeyboardWidth, m_ss_MaxInputNum, m_pc_DispField, getCharSetForPanel() );
				m_uc_nowPageNum = PNLD_ServiceDecryptPasswordP2;
				setupGamen();
			}
			break;

		default:
			break;
	}
}
