// 概要		: PServiceXMPPLeaningFunction : K4B0014300_遠隔ｻｰﾋﾞｽ設定／常時接続設定／学習機能 : テンキー .
// 備考		: なし.
//================================================================================================.
void PServiceXMPPLeaningFunction::proc10Key( uchar option )
{
	Bool bl_isError = False;

// comment 2015/11/2 [CQ519871] 調整値/下限値を選択していない時は拒否音を鳴動させる対応 日立 村上(幸).
	if( ( TYPE_RoimWscDataIF_KeepAliveCyclicMode_Static == m_st_XMPPKeepAliveSetting.m_e_KeepAliveCyclicMode )
	 || ( -1 == m_sc_Select )){
	 	// 学習機能・無効または調整値/下限値が選択されていない場合.
		setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );							// ブザー音セット.
		return;
	}

	// 学習機能を更新する.
	if( PNLE_ServiceXMPPLeaningFunctionRange == m_sc_Select ) {		// 調整値.
		m_us_VariableRange = ( ushort )proc10KeyInput( m_us_VariableRange, TYPD_RoimWscDataIF_XMPPKeepAliveSetting_CycleSpanMax, option, m_bl_DirectRange, EP_InputMaxLimitPattern_Refuse, &bl_isError );	// 調整値.
		if( True == bl_isError ) {
			setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );					// ブザー音セット.
		}
		else {
			if( ( True == m_bl_DirectRange ) && ( 1 > option ) ) {
				setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );				// ブザー音セット.
			}
			else{
				m_bl_DirectRange	= False;
			}
		}
	}
// comment 2015/11/2 [CQ519871] 上限値は不要のため、上限キーの削除対応 日立 村上(幸).
//	else if( PNLE_ServiceXMPPLeaningFunctionMax == m_sc_Select ) {	// 上限値.
//		m_us_VariableMax = ( ushort )proc10KeyInput( m_us_VariableMax, TYPD_RoimWscDataIF_XMPPKeepAliveSetting_CycleSpanMax, option, m_bl_DirectMax, EP_InputMaxLimitPattern_Refuse, &bl_isError );			// 上限値.
//		if( True == bl_isError ) {
//			setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );					// ブザー音セット.
//		}
//		else {
//			if( ( True == m_bl_DirectMax ) && ( 1 > option ) ) {
//				setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );				// ブザー音セット.
//			}
//			else{
//				m_bl_DirectMax	= False;
//			}
//		}
//	}
	else if( PNLE_ServiceXMPPLeaningFunctionMin == m_sc_Select ) {	// 下限値
		m_us_VariableMin = ( ushort )proc10KeyInput( m_us_VariableMin, TYPD_RoimWscDataIF_XMPPKeepAliveSetting_CycleSpanMax, option, m_bl_DirectMin, EP_InputMaxLimitPattern_Refuse, &bl_isError );			// 下限値.
		if( True == bl_isError ) {
			setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );					// ブザー音セット.
		}
		else {
			if( ( True == m_bl_DirectMin ) && ( 1 > option ) ) {
				setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );				// ブザー音セット.
			}
			else{
				m_bl_DirectMin	= False;
			}
		}
	}
	else {
	}

	setupGamen( option );											// 画面更新を行う.
}

//================================================================================================.
// 概要		: PServiceXMPPLeaningFunction : K4B0014300_遠隔ｻｰﾋﾞｽ設定／常時接続設定／学習機能 : クリアキー .
// 備考		: なし.
//================================================================================================.
void PServiceXMPPLeaningFunction::procClear( uchar option )
{
// comment 2015/11/2 [CQ519871] 調整値/下限値を選択していない時は拒否音を鳴動させる対応 日立 村上(幸).
	if( ( TYPE_RoimWscDataIF_KeepAliveCyclicMode_Static == m_st_XMPPKeepAliveSetting.m_e_KeepAliveCyclicMode )
	 || ( -1 == m_sc_Select )) {
	 	// 学習機能・無効または調整値/下限値が選択されていない場合.
		setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );							// ブザー音セット.
		return;
	}

	if( PNLE_ServiceXMPPLeaningFunctionRange == m_sc_Select ) {
		m_us_VariableRange = 0;										// 調整値を0にする.
		m_bl_DirectRange	= True;
	}
// comment 2015/11/2 [CQ519871] 上限値は不要のため、上限キーの削除対応 日立 村上(幸).
//	else if( PNLE_ServiceXMPPLeaningFunctionMax == m_sc_Select ) {
//		m_us_VariableMax = 0;										// 上限値を0にする.
//		m_bl_DirectMax		= True;
//	}
	else if( PNLE_ServiceXMPPLeaningFunctionMin == m_sc_Select ) {
		m_us_VariableMin = 0;										// 下限値を0にする.
		m_bl_DirectMin		= True;
	}
	else {
	}
	setupGamen( option );											// 画面更新を行う.
}

//================================================================================================.
// 概要		: PServiceXMPPLeaningFunction : K4B0014300_遠隔ｻｰﾋﾞｽ設定／常時接続設定／学習機能 : OKキー .
// 備考		: なし.
//================================================================================================.
void PServiceXMPPLeaningFunction::procOk( uchar option )
{
	if( TYPE_RoimWscDataIF_KeepAliveCyclicMode_Variable == m_st_XMPPKeepAliveSetting.m_e_KeepAliveCyclicMode ) {	// 学習機能・有効.
		if( ( m_us_VariableRange < TYPD_RoimWscDataIF_XMPPKeepAliveSetting_CycleSpanMin ) || ( TYPD_RoimWscDataIF_XMPPKeepAliveSetting_CycleSpanMax < m_us_VariableRange )
// comment 2015/11/2 [CQ519871] 上限値は不要のため、上限キーの削除対応 日立 村上(幸).
//			|| ( m_us_VariableMax < TYPD_RoimWscDataIF_XMPPKeepAliveSetting_CycleSpanMin ) || ( TYPD_RoimWscDataIF_XMPPKeepAliveSetting_CycleSpanMax < m_us_VariableMax )
			|| ( m_us_VariableMin < TYPD_RoimWscDataIF_XMPPKeepAliveSetting_CycleSpanMin ) || ( TYPD_RoimWscDataIF_XMPPKeepAliveSetting_CycleSpanMax < m_us_VariableMin )
//			|| ( m_us_VariableMax < m_us_VariableMin ) ) {				//上限値＜下限値の場合は画面遷移しない.
			) {
			setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );					// ブザー音セット.
			return;
		}
		// 遷移時に共通クラスに設定値を反映する(学習機能・有効時のみ).
		m_st_XMPPKeepAliveSetting.m_us_VariableRange	= m_us_VariableRange;
// comment 2015/11/2 [CQ519871] 上限値は不要のため、上限キーの削除対応 日立 村上(幸).
//		m_st_XMPPKeepAliveSetting.m_us_VariableMax		= m_us_VariableMax;
		m_st_XMPPKeepAliveSetting.m_us_VariableMin		= m_us_VariableMin;
	}

	PServiceXMPPKeepAliveSettingCom::procOk( option );
}

// comment 2016/09/20 ユビキタス [IT5_3.4][KRQ-278] スプール負荷分散.
//================================================================================================.
// 概要		:L0B4200000_ネットワーク設定／ポート設定 : 画面開始処理.
// 戻り値	:なし.
// 備考		:.
//================================================================================================.
void PServicePortSet::startGamen()
{
	PServiceNoFunctionCodeCom::startGamen();		// 親クラスの画面開始処理を呼び出す.
	CheckAndExecInit(); 						// 初期化処理が必要な場合、初期化処理を行う.
}
//================================================================================================.
// 概要		:L0B4200000_ネットワーク設定／ポート設定 : 画面描画処理.
// 戻り値	:なし.
// 備考		:.
//================================================================================================.
void PServicePortSet::setupGamen( short option )
{
	Btx_ServiceRawPortLoadSetTimeValue.set( ( float )m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime, ( m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime < 1 ) ? False : True );		// RAWポート負荷設定時間を入力値に設定する.
	PServiceNoFunctionCodeCom::setupGamen( option ); 	// 親クラスの画面描画処理を呼び出す.
}
//================================================================================================.
// 概要		:L0B4200000_ネットワーク設定／ポート設定 : テンキー押下処理.
// 戻り値	:なし.
// 備考		:.
//================================================================================================.
void PServicePortSet::proc10Key( uchar option )
{
	Bool bl_isError = False;				// テンキー共通処理の結果格納変数.
	if( ( True == m_bl_Direct ) && ( 1 > option ) ) {
		setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );
		return;
	}
	// テンキー共通処理を呼び出し、RAWポート負荷設定時間を更新する.
	m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime = ( int32_t )proc10KeyInputTemplate( m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime, ( int32_t )PNLD_ThresholdPortLoadMax , option, m_bl_Direct, EP_InputMaxLimitPattern_Refuse, &bl_isError );
	if( True == bl_isError ) {		// 範囲外の値入力の場合.
		setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );
	} else {						// 範囲外の値入力でない場合.
		m_bl_Direct = False;
	}
	setupGamen( option );			// 画面描画処理を呼び出す.
}
//================================================================================================.
// 概要		:L0B4200000_ネットワーク設定／ポート設定 : クリアキー押下処理.
// 戻り値	:なし.
// 備考		:.
//================================================================================================.
void PServicePortSet::procClear( uchar option )
{
	m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime = 0;		// 入力値をクリアする.
	m_bl_Direct = True;					// ダイレクト入力フラグ.
	setupGamen( option );				// 画面描画処理を呼び出す.
}
//================================================================================================.
// 概要		:L0B4200000_ネットワーク設定／ポート設定 : OKキー押下処理.
// 戻り値	:なし.
// 備考		:.
//================================================================================================.
void PServicePortSet::procOk( uchar option )
{
	if( ( PNLD_ThresholdPortLoadMin > m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime ) 
	 || ( PNLD_ThresholdPortLoadMax < m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime ) ){	// RAWポート負荷設定時間の入力値が入力範囲外の場合.
		setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );						// 拒否音を設定する.
		return;	
	}
	if( m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTimeBak != m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime ){	// 設定値が変更されていた場合.
		// RAWポート負荷設定時間を秒単位に変換してNVDに設定する.
		PnlComGetPrinterPortSetting()->setThresholdPortLoad( m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime * 60 );
	}
	bl_isRequestInitialize = True;			// 初期化フラグにTrueを格納する.
	nextGamen = &gp_ServiceNetworkMenu;		// 93B30000_ネットワーク設定／メニュー.
}
//================================================================================================.
// 概要		:L0B4200000_ネットワーク設定／ポート設定 : 初期化処理.
// 戻り値	:なし.
// 備考		:.
//================================================================================================.
void PServicePortSet::init_value()
{
	// NVDの値を分単位に修正して、RAWポート負荷設定時間に設定する.
	m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime = ( PnlComGetPrinterPortSetting()->getThresholdPortLoad() / 60 );	
	m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTimeBak = m_ui32_RawPortLoadSetTime;		// RAWポート負荷設定時間をバックアップ用変数に設定する.
	m_bl_Direct = False;		// ダイレクト入力フラグを初期化する.
}
// Comment 02/11/2017 HCLT_Devipriya【IT6_RQ-475】 Minimum MTU Network Setting.
//================================================================================================
/* Description:P0B4300000_ Service . Network Settings . MTU Settings. constructor.
      * @ Brief Constructor.
      * @ Param void.
      * @retval void.
*/ 
//================================================================================================
PServicePathMTUDiscoverySettings::PServicePathMTUDiscoverySettings( PDisplayParts** partsTable, short partsNumber, Bool isNoWarning )	// コンストラクタ.
		: PServiceNoFunctionCodeCom( partsTable, partsNumber, isNoWarning )
{
	m_ui32_MinMTUSettingsLoadSetByte = PNLD_MinimumMTUSetting_default;								// setting default value to Minimum MTU Setting.
	m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte = PNLD_ThresholdMTUSettingsLoadMax;							// Setting default value to fixed MTU Setting.
	m_bl_Direct = False;												
	m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting = 0;						// Default Path MTU discovery Option - 0
}
//================================================================================================
/* Description:P0B4300000_ Service . Network Settings . MTU Settings. screen start processing.
      * @ Brief startGamen
      * @ Param void.
      * @retval void.
*/ 
//================================================================================================
void PServicePathMTUDiscoverySettings::startGamen()
{
	PServiceNoFunctionCodeCom::startGamen();												// 親クラスの画面開始処理を呼び出す. 
	init_value();																		// 初期化処理が必要な場合、初期化処理を行う.
}
//================================================================================================
/* Description:P0B4300000_ Service . Network Settings . MTU Settings. screen rendering processing.
      * @ Brief setupGamen
      * @ Param short option.
      * @retval void.
*/ 
//================================================================================================
void PServicePathMTUDiscoverySettings::setupGamen( short option )
{
	PServiceNoFunctionCodeCom::setupGamen( option );										// 親クラスの画面描画処理を呼び出す.
	switch ( m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting ) {															// Check the option value of Path MTU Discovery setting.
		case PNLE_IP_PMTUDISC_WANT:																
			Rbt_ServicePathMTUDiscovery.select( 0 ) ;										// Select 0(IP_PMTUDISC_ WANT) button.
			break;
		case PNLE_IP_PMTUDISC_DONT:																
			Rbt_ServicePathMTUDiscovery.select( 1 ) ;										// Select 1(IP_PMTUDISC_DONT) button.
			break;
		default :
			break;
	}
	if( PNLE_IP_PMTUDISC_WANT == m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting ) {
		Grp_ServiceMinimumMTUSettingsSetParts.showEnable( True );																						//  Display Minimum MTU Settings group.
		Grp_ServiceFixedMTUSettingsSetParts.showEnable( False );
		Txt_ServiceErrorMsgIPV6Validation.showEnable( False );
		Btx_ServiceMinimumMTUSetByteValue.set( ( float ) m_ui32_MinMTUSettingsLoadSetByte, ( m_ui32_MinMTUSettingsLoadSetByte < 1 ) ? False:True);	// Display process of Minimum Discovered Path MTU input value.
	} else {
		Grp_ServiceMinimumMTUSettingsSetParts.showEnable( False );																						//  Hide Minimum MTU Settings group.
		Grp_ServiceFixedMTUSettingsSetParts.showEnable( True );																							// Display Fixed MTU Settings group.
		Btx_ServiceFixedMTUSetByteValue.set( ( float ) m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte, ( m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte < 1 ) ? False:True);	// Display process of Fixed MTU input value.
		if( TRUE == PnlComGetIPv6Setting()->getIPv6Address()) {
			Txt_ServiceFixedMTUSetByteRange.changeText( s_pNOT1280to1500_W096H016I ); //  set range 1280-1500.
			Txt_ServiceErrorMsgIPV6Validation.showEnable( False );
		} else {
			Txt_ServiceFixedMTUSetByteRange.changeText( s_pNOT68to1500_W096H016I ); //  set range to 68-1500.
			if( PNLD_ThresholdFixedMTU_IPV6SettingsLoadMin > m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte ) {
				Txt_ServiceErrorMsgIPV6Validation.showEnable( True );
			}
			else {
				Txt_ServiceErrorMsgIPV6Validation.showEnable( False );
			}
		}
	}
}
//================================================================================================
/* Description:P0B4300000_ Service . Network Settings . MTU Settings. Ten key press processing.
      * @ Brief proc10Key
      * @ Param uchar option.
      * @retval void.
*/ 
//================================================================================================
void PServicePathMTUDiscoverySettings::proc10Key( uchar option )
{
	Bool bl_isError = False;														// テンキー共通処理の結果格納変数.
	if( ( True == m_bl_Direct ) && ( 1 > option ) ) {								// When first digit of input value is less than 1.
		setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );
		return;
	}
	if( PNLE_IP_PMTUDISC_WANT == m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting ) {
		m_ui32_MinMTUSettingsLoadSetByte = ( uint32_t )proc10KeyInput( m_ui32_MinMTUSettingsLoadSetByte, ( int32_t )PNLD_ThresholdMTUSettingsLoadMax, option, m_bl_Direct, EP_InputMaxLimitPattern_Refuse, &bl_isError );//現在の値を判定し、現在値と入力値を結合した値を返す.
	} else {
		m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte = ( uint32_t )proc10KeyInput( m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte, ( int32_t )PNLD_ThresholdMTUSettingsLoadMax, option, m_bl_Direct, EP_InputMaxLimitPattern_Refuse, &bl_isError );//現在の値を判定し、現在値と入力値を結合した値を返す.	
	}
	if( True == bl_isError ) {			  											// In case of value input outside the range.
		setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );
	} else {							 											// When input value is inside range.
		m_bl_Direct = False;
	}
	setupGamen( option ); 															// 画面描画処理を呼び出す.
}
//================================================================================================
/* Description:P0B4300000_ Service . Network Settings . MTU Settings.  key press processing.
      * @ Brief procButtonOn
      * @ Param uchar option.
      * @retval void.
*/ 
//================================================================================================
void PServicePathMTUDiscoverySettings::procButtonOn( uchar option )
{
	switch( option ){
		case BTNID_ServiceMTUDiscWant:
			m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting = PNLE_IP_PMTUDISC_WANT;
			break;
		case BTNID_ServiceMTUDiscDont:
			m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting = PNLE_IP_PMTUDISC_DONT;
			break;
		default :
			break;
	}
	setupGamen( option ); 				// 画面描画処理を呼び出す.
}
//================================================================================================
/* Description:P0B4300000_ Service . Network Settings . MTU Settings. Clear key press processing.
      * @ Brief procClear
      * @ Param uchar option.
      * @retval void.
*/ 
//================================================================================================
void PServicePathMTUDiscoverySettings::procClear( uchar option )
{
	if( PNLE_IP_PMTUDISC_WANT == m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting ) {
		m_ui32_MinMTUSettingsLoadSetByte = 0;																// Clear Minimum Discovered Path MTU Setting value as 0.
	} else {
		m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte = 0;																// Clear Fixed MTU Setting value as 0.
	}
	m_bl_Direct = True;					    														// Initialize the Direct input flag.
	setupGamen( option );																			// 画面描画処理を呼び出す.
}
//================================================================================================
/* Description:P0B4300000_ Service . Network Settings . MTU Settings. Ok key press processing.
      * @ Brief procOk
      * @ Param uchar option.
      * @retval void.
*/ 
//================================================================================================
void PServicePathMTUDiscoverySettings::procOk( uchar option )
{
	if( PNLE_IP_PMTUDISC_WANT == m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting ) {
		if ( PNLD_ThresholdMTUSettingsLoadMin > m_ui32_MinMTUSettingsLoadSetByte ) 	{								// If the entered value is less than 68. 
			setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );
			return;	
		}
	} else {
		if (TRUE == PnlComGetIPv6Setting()->getIPv6Address()) {
			if ( PNLD_ThresholdFixedMTU_IPV6SettingsLoadMin > m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte ) 	{								// If the entered value is less than 1280. 
				setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );
				return;	
			}
		} else {
			if ( PNLD_ThresholdMTUSettingsLoadMin > m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte ) 	{								// If the entered value is less than 68. 
				setBuzzerType( PCGE_BuzzerType_InputNg );
				return;
			}
		}
	}
	APIC_TcpIpSetting*	pc_TcpIpSetting = APIC_TcpIpSetting::newInstance();
	if( NULL == pc_TcpIpSetting) {
		LOGF_debug_PutEventLog( LOGF_DEBUG_EVENT_KIND_ALL, 0, LOGD_DEBUG_LEVEL_UNKNOWN, "Assert Failed!" );
		return;
	}
	pc_TcpIpSetting->setIP_PMTUDiscover( m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting );						// Store the Path MTU Discovery setting value and Minimum Discovery Path MTU value.
	if( PNLE_IP_PMTUDISC_WANT == m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting ) {
		pc_TcpIpSetting->setIP_PMTU_Min( m_ui32_MinMTUSettingsLoadSetByte);
	} else {
		pc_TcpIpSetting->setIP_PMTU_Fixed( m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte); 
	}
	nextGamen = &gp_ServiceNetworkMenu;																// Screen transition occur (93B30000_ Network Setting / Menu).
}
//================================================================================================
/* Description:P0B4300000_ Service . Network Settings . MTU Settings. Initialization processing.
      * @ Brief init_value
      * @ Param void.
      * @retval void.
*/ 
//================================================================================================
void PServicePathMTUDiscoverySettings::init_value()
{
	APIC_TcpIpSetting*	pc_TcpIpSetting 	= APIC_TcpIpSetting::newInstance();
	if( NULL == pc_TcpIpSetting) {
		LOGF_debug_PutEventLog( LOGF_DEBUG_EVENT_KIND_ALL, 0, LOGD_DEBUG_LEVEL_UNKNOWN, "Assert Failed!" );
		return;
	}
	m_ui32_MTUDiscSetting 					= pc_TcpIpSetting->getIP_PMTUDiscover();
	m_ui32_MinMTUSettingsLoadSetByte 		= pc_TcpIpSetting->getIP_PMTU_Min();
	m_ui32_FixedMTUSettingsLoadSetByte 		= pc_TcpIpSetting->getIP_PMTU_Fixed();
	m_bl_Direct = False;													// Initialize the direct input flag.
}
